---
/* Section 2: the world that changes, before any feature. */
---

<section class="section future" id="vision" aria-labelledby="future-title">
  <div class="container future__grid">
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">A different way to build</p>
      <h2 class="h2" id="future-title">
        What if building a business didn't require building a team first?
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose" data-reveal>
      <p>
        For generations, starting a business meant assembling people, finding expertise,
        managing tools and coordinating countless activities.
      </p>
      <p><strong>The opportunity is changing.</strong></p>
      <p>
        Imagine a world where an individual can access the intelligence and execution
        capabilities traditionally found across an entire company. A world where more people can
        turn their knowledge, creativity and ambition into sustainable businesses.
      </p>
      <p class="future__end">That is the future we are building toward.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .future__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .future__end {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .future__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
